{"type":"message","id":"8d6f927e","parentId":"f84f670f","timestamp":"2026-02-18T13:59:24.225Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Great progress! I now have a list of script files:\n\n- D:\\workspace\\appDev\\openclaw\\.openclaw-state\\workspace\\scripts\\gateway-wrapper.bat\n- D:\\workspace\\appDev\\openclaw\\.openclaw-state\\workspace\\scripts\\install-service.bat\n\nAgentHr path not found. Skills directory exists? The third command gave no output, meaning either the path doesn't exist or there are no matching script files. Let me verify the skills path existence separately.\n\nNow I need to check the contents of these two batch files for loops or self-restarting patterns. I'll read their contents.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"Excellent! I found two batch files in the scripts folder. Now let me read their contents to look for loops or self-restarting patterns:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_3fb51e023b28455c82cfeff2","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"D:\\workspace\\appDev\\openclaw\\.openclaw-state\\workspace\\scripts\\gateway-wrapper.bat"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_387222ac80e2460f844071b1","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"D:\\workspace\\appDev\\openclaw\\.openclaw-state\\workspace\\scripts\\install-service.bat"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"stepfun/step-3.5-flash:free","usage":{"input":21391,"output":410,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21801,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771423159859}}
